{"id":"d_counseling_hongryeon_goddeath_18","cat":"counsel","group":{"id":"char5186","label":"Scarlet: Goddeath"},"label":"Advising Scarlet: Goddeath: 18","stage":null,"prev":"d_counseling_hongryeon_goddeath_17","next":"d_counseling_hongryeon_goddeath_19","speakers":{"hongryeon_g":"Scarlet"},"icons":{"hongryeon_g":"si_c472_00_s"},"lines":[{"id":"d_counseling_hongryeon_goddeath_18_1","type":"Speech","speaker":"hongryeon_g","key":"Locale_Counseling:d_counseling_hongryeon_goddeath_18_1","text":"My Lord, what hath so darkened thy countenance?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":"CommanderRoom","bgArt":"commanderroom","image":null,"bgm":"bgm_story_backtonormal","movie":null,"shown":["hongryeon_g"],"affinity":"_0"},{"id":"d_counseling_hongryeon_goddeath_18_2","type":"Choice","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_Counseling:d_counseling_hongryeon_goddeath_18_2","text":"I-it's nothing, really.","jump":"d_counseling_hongryeon_goddeath_18_4","exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":"_100"},{"id":"d_counseling_hongryeon_goddeath_18_3","type":"Choice","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_Counseling:d_counseling_hongryeon_goddeath_18_3","text":"... I'm not sure why, but I feel a little restless and uneasy.","jump":"d_counseling_hongryeon_goddeath_18_7","exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":"_120"},{"id":"d_counseling_hongryeon_goddeath_18_4","type":"Speech","speaker":"hongryeon_g","key":"Locale_Counseling:d_counseling_hongryeon_goddeath_18_4","text":"Forsooth, there must needs be troubles which thou findest difficult to lay bare.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":"_0"},{"id":"d_counseling_hongryeon_goddeath_18_5","type":"Speech","speaker":"hongryeon_g","key":"Locale_Counseling:d_counseling_hongryeon_goddeath_18_5","text":"Yet at times, giving voice to such burdens may bring some measure of relief.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":"_0"},{"id":"d_counseling_hongryeon_goddeath_18_6","type":"Speech","speaker":"hongryeon_g","key":"Locale_Counseling:d_counseling_hongryeon_goddeath_18_6","text":"Whensoever thy heart is troubled, thou art welcome to confide in me.","jump":"d_counseling_hongryeon_goddeath_18_13","exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":"_0"},{"id":"d_counseling_hongryeon_goddeath_18_7","type":"Speech","speaker":"hongryeon_g","key":"Locale_Counseling:d_counseling_hongryeon_goddeath_18_7","text":"So it is.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":"_0"},{"id":"d_counseling_hongryeon_goddeath_18_8","type":"Speech","speaker":"hongryeon_g","key":"Locale_Counseling:d_counseling_hongryeon_goddeath_18_8","text":"... Art thou familiar with the saying, \"No flower remaineth red for ten days\"?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":"_0"},{"id":"d_counseling_hongryeon_goddeath_18_9","type":"Speech","speaker":"hongryeon_g","key":"Locale_Counseling:d_counseling_hongryeon_goddeath_18_9","text":"It speaks of how no flower bloometh forever.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":"_0"},{"id":"d_counseling_hongryeon_goddeath_18_10","type":"Speech","speaker":"hongryeon_g","key":"Locale_Counseling:d_counseling_hongryeon_goddeath_18_10","text":"To behold it whilst it bloometh, and bid it farewell when its blossoms fade... thus may one keep a flower by one's side for the longest while.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":"_0"},{"id":"d_counseling_hongryeon_goddeath_18_11","type":"Speech","speaker":"hongryeon_g","key":"Locale_Counseling:d_counseling_hongryeon_goddeath_18_11","text":"Thou, too, shouldst set aside thy impatience for a time. The more fiercely thou strivest to hold on, the farther it shall slip from thy grasp.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":"_0"},{"id":"d_counseling_hongryeon_goddeath_18_12","type":"Speech","speaker":"hongryeon_g","key":"Locale_Counseling:d_counseling_hongryeon_goddeath_18_12","text":"Such is the way of the world. In letting go, one may yet come to possess that which could not otherwise be had.","jump":"d_counseling_hongryeon_goddeath_18_13","exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":"_0"},{"id":"d_counseling_hongryeon_goddeath_18_13","type":"Narration","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_Counseling:d_counseling_hongryeon_goddeath_18_13","text":"I tentatively open up to Scarlet about my troubles.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":"none","bgArt":"none","image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":"_0"}]}